      "code": "def edit_distance(a, b):\n    m, n = len(a), len(b)\n    prev = list(range(n + 1))\n    for i in range(1, m + 1):\n        curr = [i] + [0] * n\n        for j in range(1, n + 1):\n            curr[j] = min(\n                prev[j] + 1,\n                curr[j - 1] + 1,\n                prev[j - 1] + (a[i - 1] != b[j - 1]),\n            )\n        prev = curr\n    return prev[n]",
